  AUTHORS   Han LL, Yin XR and Zhang SQ.
  TITLE     miR-103 promotes the metastasis and EMT of hepatocellular carcinoma
            by directly inhibiting LATS2
  JOURNAL   Int J Oncol 53 (6), 2433-2444 (2018)
   PUBMED   30272278
