  TITLE     Parathyroid hormone-stimulation of Runx2 during osteoblast
            differentiation via the regulation of lnc-SUPT3H-1:16
            (RUNX2-AS1:32) and miR-6797-5p
  JOURNAL   Biochimie 158, 43-52 (2019)
   PUBMED   30562548
  REMARK    GeneRIF: Thus, PTH stimulated the expression of lnc-SUPT3H-1:16,
            miR-6797-5p and Runx2, and due to the sponging mechanism of lnc-
            SUPT3H-1:16 towards miR-6797-5p, Runx2 was protected, resulting in
            the promotion of osteoblast differentiation.
