REFERENCE   1  (bases 1 to 84)
  AUTHORS   Shi SH, Jiang J, Zhang W, Sun L, Li XJ, Li C, Ge QD and Zhuang ZG.
  TITLE     A Novel lncRNA HOXC-AS3 Acts as a miR-3922-5p Sponge to Promote
            Breast Cancer Metastasis
  JOURNAL   Cancer Invest. 38 (1), 1-12 (2020)
   PUBMED   31797701
  REMARK    GeneRIF: HOXC-AS3 is aberrantly overexpressed in breast cancers
            especially the HER2+ type. High expression of HOXC-AS3 has a
            relationship with poor clinical outcomes of breast cancer. HOXC-AS3
            regulates cell invasion and migration both in vitro and in vivo.
            Results demonstrated that miR-3922-5p was a direct target of
            HOXC-AS3, and PPP1R1A was a target of miR-3922-5p in breast cancer.
