REFERENCE   1  (bases 1 to 65)
  AUTHORS   Yan S, Jiang Y, Liang C, Cheng M, Jin C, Duan Q, Xu D, Yang L,
            Zhang X, Ren B and Jin P.
  TITLE     Exosomal miR-6803-5p as potential diagnostic and prognostic marker
            in colorectal cancer
  JOURNAL   J. Cell. Biochem. 119 (5), 4113-4119 (2018)
   PUBMED   29240249
  REMARK    GeneRIF: Cox regression analysis revealed high levels of exosomal
            miR-6803-5p was associated with poor prognosis in colorectal cancer
            (CRC) independent of other confounding factors. Thus, exosomal
            miR-6803-5p is a potential diagnostic and prognostic biomarker for
            patients with CRC.
