  JOURNAL   Hum. Mol. Genet. 26 (20), 4086-4092 (2017)
   PUBMED   29016859
  REMARK    GeneRIF: In silico and in vitro analyses identified a functional
            variant, rs35333564 in MIR4300HG, the host gene of a microRNA,
            MIR4300. The genomic region containing rs35333564 had enhancer
